    {
      "text": "腐化持续蔓延压缩安全区，以空间压力替代倒计时",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The corruption is spreading, the safe zone is shrinking, and the monsters are getting deadlier by the second. There’s no timer here—just the suffocating pressure of the encroaching rot and endless unknown challenges.",
