      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "深入危险区猎杀精英领主刷取职业专属套装",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Fortune favors the bold. Dive into danger zones to hunt down elite lords and farm class-exclusive sets. Challenge your survival limits with insane drop rates. Rip through your enemies and reap the treasures!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4337210/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "职业机制与九位神祇祝福组合雷电或冰冻流派",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Combine unique class mechanics with the blessings of 9 different deities to create wild strategic synergies. Rain down lightning or freeze the path ahead? With hundreds of tactical combinations, you can craft your own unique playstyle and master the aesthetic of violent harvest.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4337210/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
